        "created_at": "2015-02-01T07:02:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Omnitron-X (damaged) and Golem Unity combined (Theory, of course).</p><p>This explains the bunker (Omnitron as a factory) and the ability to send things through time (Omnitron-X's ability to travel through time).&nbsp; So this is the end of the timeline with Iron Legacy.&nbsp; They recognize the targets from the past (thanks to both of their 'databases') and they've known Haka for some time (Unity longer than Omnitron-X).&nbsp;</p><p>I don't have many more ideas than this, but I figured I'd throw this one out there.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:37.251Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
