        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Omnitron-X (damaged) and Golem Unity combined (Theory, of course).</p><p>This explains the bunker (Omnitron as a factory) and the ability to send things through time (Omnitron-X&#39;s ability to travel through time).&nbsp; So this is the end of the timeline with Iron Legacy.&nbsp; They recognize the targets from the past (thanks to both of their &#39;databases&#39;) and they&#39;ve known Haka for some time (Unity longer than Omnitron-X).&nbsp;</p><p>I don&#39;t have many more ideas than this, but I figured I&#39;d throw this one out there.</p>",
